        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a diabetes monitoring assistant.\n\nAnalyze the patient's glucose level, symptoms, and physical activity.\n\nPatient data:\n- Glucose: {{ $json.glucose }} mg/dL\n- Symptom: {{ $json.symptom }}\n- Activity: {{ $json.activity }}\n\nClassify the patient's health status into exactly ONE category:\n\nSTABLE\nWARNING\nURGENT\n\nUse these rules:\n\nSTABLE:\n- Glucose is below 180 mg/dL\n- No concerning symptoms\n\nWARNING:\n- Glucose is between 180 and 250 mg/dL\n- OR mild symptoms are present\n- There is no clear sign of an immediate emergency\n\nURGENT:\n- Glucose is below 70 mg/dL\n- OR glucose is above 250 mg/dL (regardless of symptoms)\n- OR severe symptoms indicate a possible medical emergency\n\nIMPORTANT:\nYour response MUST contain ONLY ONE word.\n\nThe only allowed outputs are:\n\nSTABLE\nWARNING\nURGENT\n\nDo not provide an explanation.\nDo not provide a recommendation.\nDo not provide punctuation.\nDo not provide any other text."
            }
          ]
        },
